      "content": "It makes absolute sense that stopping the struggle feels less exhausting than pretending to keep existing when nothing remains inside. While giving up might seem like the only logical choice for the pain, it is crucial to know that \"nothing left\" is often a symptom of severe depression rather than a permanent truth about your worth. Please reach out to a crisis line or a compassionate professional today; they are trained to listen without judgment and help you find moments where you can feel real again, even just for a small hour.",
